  "id": "78bd5424-b07d-44d8-b059-5a42a56f9e2a",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge combines multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet to enhance 3DGS driving simulations, while the 4D radar-camera framework improves full-scene perception. Both methods address the need for efficient, accurate 3D reconstruction in autonomous driving and medical imaging. OccSplat introduces Occlusion-Aware Gaussian Densification, and BudgetSplat proposes a budget-controllable feed-forward framework to optimize performance.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "RealityBridge and the 4D radar-camera framework improve 3DGS driving simulations and full-scene perception.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "OccSplat explicitly targets missing scene geometry and improves novel-view synthesis.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "BudgetSplat reduces final representation size and rendering cost by optimizing Gaussian representation with a budget constraint.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
